Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:27:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] SR-Source Net Plus: exact float helpers on MSVC, fallback
 counter

The state measured on 2026-11-24 (runner and modules of phase 0):
- GXRuntime: psq dequantize/quantize scale by an exact power of two
  instead of ldexp/ldexpf, and isnan/isinf/signbit inline on MSVC
  (fp_fast_classify.h). Same results, no CRT call.
- StaticRecomp: SRNP_FALLBACK_STATS=1 counts HookInstructionFallback
  calls per guest address and prints them at shutdown (measurement only).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
